      "$kind": "problem",
      "Header": "The code that looked fine",
      "Intro": "Lazy loading fires one extra query for every row.",
      "RowsText": "SELECT * FROM Orders | 1\u00D7\nSELECT * FROM Customers | 100\u00D7\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM Items | 100\u00D7",
      "BulletsText": "Fast with 10 rows in dev\nSlow with 100 rows under load\nNo error, no warning",
      "Dir": "Auto",
