    {
      "$kind": "notes",
      "Header": "What we learned",
      "BulletsText": "Small test data hides scale bugs, so assert query counts in integration tests.\nTurn lazy loading off. If you need the data, ask for it explicitly.\nKeep LogTo on in dev so every query is visible.\nBefore buying hardware, count your queries.",
      "Dir": "Auto",
